      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Make as many orders from the bulletin board as you can before time runs
    out!


    Cook, chop, and assemble ingredients on plates, then send them out
    on the conveyor belt by dinging the bell.


    Careful with plates, tip them
    too far and the ingredients will spill!


    Orders expire over time, so keep
    an eye on the timers!'
